# [[capitalism]] {{gloss|socio-economic formation, based on private ownership rights}}
#: {{syn|ru|ча́стное предпринима́тельство}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|author= w:ru:Владимир Ленин<t:{{w|Vladimir Lenin}}>|year= 1913|month= March|year_published= 1973|title= Три источника и три составных части марксизма|series= В. И. Ленин – Полное собрание сочинений|seriesvolume= 23|page= 46|pageurl= https://archive.org/details/28_20201018_20201018_1648/%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BD%20%D0%92.%D0%98._%D0%9F%D0%A1%D0%A1%20%D1%82.%2023/page/46/mode/2up
|newversion= English translation from
|year2= 1973|origlang2= ru|title2= The Three Sources and Three Component Parts of Marxism|series2= V. I. Lenin – Collected Works|seriesvolume2= 19
